Allow concrete type parameter to be included in function calls; and require it
when the parameter is not deducible.  e.g
def mkEmpty[A](): List[A] = []; val xs = mkEmpty[Int]()
Also require type to be deducible in instances of "[]".  I think this can be
done by having TypeChecker0.close check that t contains no TypeVars.

