There are three related traits corresponding to cell types:

- CellValueType: types of values that can appear in cells; includes ErrorType
  and EmptyType
- CellType: corresponds to script type of same name: IntType, FloatType, 
  BoolType, StringType
- CellReadType : the type associated with a typed cell read, CellType or 
  TypeParam.

If CellExp has a type parameter, make sure it satisfies CellTypeConstraint

